-- חוזר לבעלויות תשפ"ו/4 (25.8.2025): פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות
-- From school year תשפ"ו, the owners of recognised unofficial regular
-- kindergartens open an online file at the Ministry for every kindergarten
-- teacher and report her position every year: the reporting officer, the
-- three stages of a file, the gradual start, the employment approval, the
-- position report and requests to employ beyond a full position.

IMPORT prelude
IMPORT common

-- Time is counted in DAYS from 1 September 2025 (day 0), the day the
-- circular's system opens; the dates it prints, as day numbers:
`25 August 2025`    MEANS -7
`31 August 2025`    MEANS -1
`1 September 2025`  MEANS 0
`8 September 2025`  MEANS 7
`1 November 2025`   MEANS 61
`1 December 2025`   MEANS 91
`1 March 2026`      MEANS 181
`30 April 2026`     MEANS 241

§ `תשפ"ו/4 פתיחת תיקי גננות ודיווח משרות`

-- akn:preamble The letterhead, date (25.8.2025), reference, addressee (owners of recognised unofficial regular kindergartens), greeting and subject line; no rule.
-- akn:preamble/p14 A recital: government decision 3191 of 1.7.2025, under which the Ministry prepares online files for kindergarten teachers.
-- akn:preamble/p15 The circular's purpose, introducing its two topics.
-- akn:art_1 The first topic of the purpose list ("פתיחת תיקים לגננות"), encoded under stages A-B below.
-- akn:art_2/p1 The second topic of the purpose list ("דיווח המשרות של הגננות"), encoded under stage D below.
-- akn:art_2/p2 The heading of the introduction; no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p4 The purpose of the move (an information and management infrastructure); no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p8 A request to follow the instructions below, and why; the duties themselves are encoded below.
-- akn:art_2/p12 The circular speaks of teaching staff in the feminine and means both; no rule.
-- akn:art_2/p13 The heading of the list of actions required of the owner; no rule.

@desc The actors of this circular; the reporting officer and the Ministry's units are not among common.l4's parties, so the circular has its own.
DECLARE `kindergarten-files party` IS ONE OF
    `the owning body`
    `the owner's contact person`
    `the reporting officer`
    `the kindergarten teacher`
    `the national service and information centre`
    `the teaching-staff division`
    `the Ministry`

DECLARE `kindergarten-files action` IS ONE OF
    `open an online file`
    `report the employment for the year`
    `update the data`
    `define one reporting officer` HAS `officer defined` IS A `reporting officer candidate`
    `file the permission request form in the owners' portal`
    `set up the permission`
    `pass the permission to another person`
    `request a change of reporting officer in writing`
    `instruct the teachers to open an online file`
    `fill and send the questionnaire with education and seniority documents`
    `approve the file, certify the documents as true copies and report the institution`
    `update grade and seniority, approve the documents and the file`
    `instruct the teachers to check their education and seniority data`
    `obtain an employment approval`
    `report the teacher's position in the placement system`
    `report a placement above a full position` HAS `placement size reported` IS A NUMBER
    `delete and re-enter an approved request`
    `take steps against the owning body, including weighing the effect on its budget`
    `choose the role`
    `report the placement data`
    `press save`
    `submit the request in the entitlements module with its reasons`
    `determine education, certification and seniority for salary`
    `grant employment approvals and check criminal records`

§§ `2 Introduction: the duty to open files and report`

-- From תשפ"ו every teaching employee in a recognised unofficial
-- kindergarten opens an online file, and the owning body reports her
-- employment every year. The owning body's duty is to open the files,
-- update the data and report the positions of all its kindergarten teachers;
-- against an owner who does not, the Ministry may take steps, including
-- weighing the effect on the owner's budget.
-- The opening of files and the updating of data carry no deadline in the
-- text; the report is yearly ("מדי שנה בשנה").
@ref akn:art_2/p3 akn:art_2/p9 akn:art_2/p10
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the owning body's duties to open, update and report` IS
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `open an online file`
     LEST  PARTY `the Ministry`
           MAY   `take steps against the owning body, including weighing the effect on its budget`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the owning body`
     MUST  `update the data`
     LEST  PARTY `the Ministry`
           MAY   `take steps against the owning body, including weighing the effect on its budget`)
    RAND
    `the owning body's yearly report`

GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the owning body's yearly report` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `report the employment for the year`
    WITHIN 365
    HENCE FULFILLED
    LEST  PARTY `the Ministry`
          MAY   `take steps against the owning body, including weighing the effect on its budget`

-- With the information reported, the Ministry, as regulator of the teaching
-- staff in the institutions it supervises and funds, may determine the
-- teachers' education grade, certification and seniority for salary and
-- further rights (in-service training allowances, the jubilee grant), and
-- may grant employment approvals and check criminal records.
@ref akn:art_2/p5 akn:art_2/p6 akn:art_2/p7
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `what the Ministry may do with the information` IS
    (PARTY `the Ministry`
     MAY   `determine education, certification and seniority for salary`)
    RAND
    (PARTY `the Ministry`
     MAY   `grant employment approvals and check criminal records`)

-- Nothing in the circular derogates from government decision 3191 of
-- 1.7.2025 (not in the corpus).
@ref akn:art_2/p11
`the circular derogates from government decision 3191` MEANS FALSE

§§ `2.1 שלב א' – the reporting officer`

@desc The person an owning body names as its reporting officer.
DECLARE `reporting officer candidate` HAS
    `an employee of the owning body`  IS A BOOLEAN @desc in an employer-employee relation with the owning body
    `a service provider`              IS A BOOLEAN @desc engaged as a provider of services, not as an employee
    `from human resources`            IS A BOOLEAN

-- The owning body defines ONE reporting officer, its own employee (not a
-- service provider), preferably from human resources ("רצוי": a
-- recommendation, not a condition), who receives the permission "אחראי
-- דיווח גני ילדים מוכר שאינו רשמי". The text sets no deadline.
@ref akn:art_2__para_1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the owning body defines its reporting officer` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `define one reporting officer` c
          PROVIDED `may be the reporting officer` c

GIVEN c IS A `reporting officer candidate`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `may be the reporting officer` c IF
    c's `an employee of the owning body` AND NOT c's `a service provider`

-- The owner's contact files the permission request form in the owners'
-- portal; the national centre checks it and sets up the permission.
@ref akn:art_2__para_1/p2 akn:art_2__para_1/p3
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the reporting officer's permission` IS
    PARTY `the owner's contact person`
    MUST  `file the permission request form in the owners' portal`
    HENCE (PARTY `the national service and information centre`
           MUST  `set up the permission`)

-- The permission is personal: it may not be passed to another contact;
-- a change of reporting officer needs a written request to the Ministry.
@ref akn:art_2__para_1/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the permission is personal` IS
    PARTY `the reporting officer`
    SHANT `pass the permission to another person`
    LEST BREACH BY `the reporting officer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/4 §2.1: the permission is personal and may not be passed on"

@ref akn:art_2__para_1/p4
GIVEN `the owner wants another reporting officer` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `a change of reporting officer` `the owner wants another reporting officer` IS
    IF `the owner wants another reporting officer`
    THEN PARTY `the owning body`
         MUST  `request a change of reporting officer in writing`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- No more than one reporting officer is approved for an owning body.
@ref akn:art_2__para_1/p5
`the most reporting officers an owning body may have` MEANS 1

GIVEN `reporting officers requested` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `reporting officers approved` `reporting officers requested` IS
    min `reporting officers requested` `the most reporting officers an owning body may have`

§§ `2.2 שלב ב' – the online file`

-- Every year the owning body instructs its kindergarten teachers, new and
-- veteran alike if no file was opened for them before, to open an online
-- file through the teaching-staff portal.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_a
GIVEN `a file was opened before` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the yearly instruction to open files` `a file was opened before` IS
    IF `a file was opened before`
    THEN FULFILLED
    ELSE PARTY `the owning body`
         MUST  `instruct the teachers to open an online file`
         WITHIN 365

-- 2.2ד: the file is opened in three stages, each by its own party, in
-- order: the teacher fills and sends the questionnaire (2.2ב: personal and
-- education details, a placement request, declarations and documents); the
-- owner's reporting officer approves the file, certifies the documents as
-- true copies and reports the institution code (2.2ג); the teaching-staff
-- division updates grade and seniority and approves. The circular sets no
-- time for any stage.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_b akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_c akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_d akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_d/p2 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_d/p3 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_d/p4
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the three stages of a file` IS
    PARTY `the kindergarten teacher`
    MUST  `fill and send the questionnaire with education and seniority documents`
    HENCE (PARTY `the reporting officer`
           MUST  `approve the file, certify the documents as true copies and report the institution`
           HENCE (PARTY `the teaching-staff division`
                  MUST  `update grade and seniority, approve the documents and the file`))

-- akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_e Detailed instructions are published in the teachers' portal and a guide is to be updated; no rule.

-- 2.2ו: the owning body instructs the teachers already in the Ministry's
-- database to check in the portal that their education and seniority data
-- are current. Further data are updated through the district's
-- teaching-staff unit, in one of three ways.
@ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the instruction to existing teachers` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `instruct the teachers to check their education and seniority data`

-- Further data are updated through the district, in one of the three ways
-- listed below and no other.
GIVEN w IS A `way to update data`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `an accepted way to update data` w IF
    CONSIDER w
    WHEN `another way` THEN FALSE
    OTHERWISE TRUE

DECLARE `way to update data` IS ONE OF
    @ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p2
    `the teacher brings the originals to the district at reception hours`
    @ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p3
    `the teacher mails the originals to the district`
    @ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p4
    `the reporting officer e-mails true copies to the district`
    `another way`

-- akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p5 Where to find which district an institution belongs to; no rule.
-- akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p6 Points to attached portal instructions for opening a file; they are not in the corpus.
-- akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p7 The heading "פתיחת תיקים הדרגתית"; no rule.

§§§ `The gradual start`

DECLARE `district` IS ONE OF
    `the Haredi district`
    `another district`

-- By the government decision, files are opened gradually (2.2ו, ¶8):
-- owners in every district but the Haredi one from 1.9.2025, handled by
-- their district (א); owners in the Haredi district by the number of their
-- kindergartens (ב).
@desc A row of the Haredi district's schedule: owners with this many kindergartens start on this day.
DECLARE `start row` HAS
    `fewest kindergartens` IS A NUMBER
    `most kindergartens`   IS A NUMBER  @desc 999999 stands for "ויותר"
    `start day`            IS A NUMBER

@ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_b akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_b/p2 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_b/p3 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_b/p4 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_b/p5
`the Haredi district's schedule` MEANS
    LIST `start row` 150 999999 `1 September 2025`,
         `start row` 15  149    `1 December 2025`,
         `start row` 1   14     `1 March 2026`

GIVEN n IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A LIST OF NUMBER
DECIDE `the start days the schedule gives for` n IS
    map (GIVEN r YIELD r's `start day`)
        (filter (GIVEN r YIELD n AT LEAST r's `fewest kindergartens` AND n AT MOST r's `most kindergartens`)
                `the Haredi district's schedule`)

-- The schedule is a function: every owner with from 1 to 400 kindergartens
-- has exactly one start day.
#ASSERT all (GIVEN n YIELD count (`the start days the schedule gives for` n) EQUALS 1) (range 1 400)

@ref akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f/p8 akn:art_2__para_2__subpara_f__cls_a
GIVEN d IS A `district`, `kindergartens owned` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the day file requests open` d `kindergartens owned` IS
    CONSIDER d
    WHEN `another district` THEN `1 September 2025`
    WHEN `the Haredi district` THEN sum (`the start days the schedule gives for` `kindergartens owned`)

GIVEN d IS A `district`, `kindergartens owned` IS A NUMBER, `day` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the owner may file requests to open files on` d `kindergartens owned` `day` IF
    `day` AT LEAST `the day file requests open` d `kindergartens owned`

§§ `3 שלב ג' – the employment approval`

-- The owning body obtains an employment approval for every teaching
-- employee it employs, on the conditions of the procedure for candidates
-- for employment by owning bodies for תשפ"ו (not in the corpus).
@ref akn:art_3/p1
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `an employment approval for every teacher` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `obtain an employment approval`

§§ `4 שלב ד' – reporting the positions`

-- After the file is opened, every kindergarten teacher the owning body
-- employs is reported in the Ministry's systems; the duty is every owning
-- body's, once its files are opened. The report is made in the placement
-- system, and only once a reporting officer is defined (א) and the file
-- opened (ב); entry is by personal identification.
@ref akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2 akn:art_4/p3 akn:art_4__para_a akn:art_4__para_b akn:art_4__para_b/p2
GIVEN `a reporting officer is defined` IS A BOOLEAN, `the file is opened` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the position can be reported` `a reporting officer is defined` `the file is opened` IF
    `a reporting officer is defined` AND `the file is opened`

@ref akn:art_4/p1 akn:art_4/p2
GIVEN `a reporting officer is defined` IS A BOOLEAN, `the file is opened` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the duty to report the position` `a reporting officer is defined` `the file is opened` IS
    IF `the position can be reported` `a reporting officer is defined` `the file is opened`
    THEN PARTY `the owning body`
         MUST  `report the teacher's position in the placement system`
    ELSE FULFILLED

-- akn:art_4__para_b/p3 Operational support is given by the national service and information centre; no rule.

§§§ `דיווח משרות`

DECLARE `kindergarten role` IS ONE OF
    @desc גננת מרכזת (מנהלת גן): the role is chosen in stage A of the report
    `coordinating teacher`
    @desc גננת עמיתה (משלימה): no role is entered for her
    `associate teacher`

-- א–ב: every teaching employee in the kindergarten is reported in the
-- placement system by the kindergarten's code, with position data, weekly
-- hours, role and position size.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_a akn:art_4__hc_1__para_b
@desc A position report in the placement system.
DECLARE `position report` HAS
    `kindergarten code`     IS A STRING
    `weekly hours`          IS A NUMBER
    `role reported`         IS A `kindergarten role`
    `position size`         IS A NUMBER  @desc the position as a fraction of a full one (1 = 100%)

GIVEN r IS A `position report`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the report names a kindergarten` r IF
    NOT (r's `kindergarten code` EQUALS "")

-- ג: the pre-reform position base is 30 weekly hours for both roles.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_c akn:art_4__hc_1__para_c/p2
GIVEN role IS A `kindergarten role`
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `the pre-reform position base in weekly hours` role IS
    CONSIDER role
    WHEN `coordinating teacher` THEN 30
    WHEN `associate teacher` THEN 30

-- ד: the reporting officer places the teacher through "עו"ה חדש במוסד",
-- after her file is opened.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_d
GIVEN `the file is opened` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reporting officer may place the teacher` `the file is opened` IF
    `the file is opened`

-- ה: three stages, in order: the role (a coordinating teacher's role is
-- chosen, an associate's is not entered); the placement data (position,
-- standard-hours type "לא מתקן מוסד", from and to dates, weekly hours, the
-- reason "עובד בעלות", hours type, replacement); and "save", which confirms
-- the report.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p2 akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p3 akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p4 akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p5 akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p6 akn:art_4__hc_1__para_e/p7
GIVEN role IS A `kindergarten role`
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the three stages of a position report` role IS
    IF `a role is entered for` role
    THEN PARTY `the reporting officer`
         MUST  `choose the role`
         HENCE `the placement data, then save`
    ELSE `the placement data, then save`

GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `the placement data, then save` IS
    PARTY `the reporting officer`
    MUST  `report the placement data`
    HENCE (PARTY `the reporting officer`
           MUST  `press save`)

GIVEN role IS A `kindergarten role`
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a role is entered for` role IF
    CONSIDER role
    WHEN `coordinating teacher` THEN TRUE
    WHEN `associate teacher` THEN FALSE

-- ו: beyond a full position, the total weekly hours may not pass 140% in
-- all modes of employment and types of hours; employment in several
-- institutions, or under reform and pre-reform terms at once, needs a
-- request in the entitlements system; and in any case no more than 42
-- weekly hours are approved.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_f akn:art_4__hc_1__para_f/p2
GIVEN `position size` IS A NUMBER, `weekly hours` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `within the ceilings` `position size` `weekly hours` IF
    `position size` AT MOST 1.4 AND `weekly hours` AT MOST 42

@ref akn:art_4__hc_1__para_f
GIVEN `employed in several institutions or under reform and pre-reform terms at once` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `a request in the entitlements system is needed` `employed in several institutions or under reform and pre-reform terms at once` IF
    `employed in several institutions or under reform and pre-reform terms at once`

-- On the pre-reform base of 30 weekly hours, 140% is exactly 42 hours: the
-- two ceilings of ו agree.
#ASSERT 1.4 TIMES `the pre-reform position base in weekly hours` `coordinating teacher` EQUALS 42

-- akn:art_4__hc_1__para_f/p3 A link to the procedure for employment above 100% in תשפ"ו in recognised unofficial education; the procedure is not in the corpus.

§§§ `Employment beyond a full position (up to 140%)`

@desc An entitlement request beyond a full position.
DECLARE `entitlement request` HAS
    `request position size` IS A NUMBER
    `request weekly hours`  IS A NUMBER
    `request from day`      IS A NUMBER
    `request to day`        IS A NUMBER

-- א: requests to employ a teacher beyond a full position are submitted
-- through the entitlements module of the placement system, with the reason
-- for exceeding the full position given at length. The text names no
-- submitter and no deadline.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_a akn:art_4__hc_2__para_a/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `a request beyond a full position goes through the entitlements module` IS
    PARTY `the owning body`
    MUST  `submit the request in the entitlements module with its reasons`

-- akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b/p2 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b/p3 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b/p4 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b/p5 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_b/p6 The screens and fields through which א's request is filed (menu, ID, entitlement type, total position, reason, save) and the system's calculator; a guide to the system, no rule beyond א's.

-- ג: the request goes to the teaching-staff headquarters; only after it is
-- approved may a placement above the full position, up to the requested
-- size, be reported.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_c
GIVEN `approved position size` IS A NUMBER @desc the size in the approved request (1 where none is approved)
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `no placement above the approved size` `approved position size` IS
    PARTY `the reporting officer`
    SHANT `report a placement above a full position` size
          PROVIDED size GREATER THAN max 1 `approved position size`
    LEST BREACH BY `the reporting officer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/4 §4: a placement above a full position is reported only after the entitlement is approved"

@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_c
GIVEN `approved position size` IS A NUMBER, `reported position size` IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
DECIDE `the reported placement is allowed` `approved position size` `reported position size` IF
    `reported position size` AT MOST max 1 `approved position size`

-- ד: a change of size or period of an approved request: never delete and
-- re-enter; update the existing request. From the final approval of the
-- new one, the earlier lapses; until it is approved or refused, the earlier
-- stays in force.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p2
GIVETH A DEONTIC `kindergarten-files party` `kindergarten-files action`
DECIDE `no deleting an approved request` IS
    PARTY `the reporting officer`
    SHANT `delete and re-enter an approved request`
    LEST BREACH BY `the reporting officer` BECAUSE "תשפ\"ו/4 §4ד: an approved request is updated, never deleted and re-entered"

@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p2 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p5 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p6
GIVEN earlier IS AN `entitlement request`, updated IS AN `entitlement request`, `the update is finally approved` IS A BOOLEAN
GIVETH AN `entitlement request`
DECIDE `the request in force` earlier updated `the update is finally approved` IS
    IF `the update is finally approved` THEN updated ELSE earlier

-- The circular's worked example (¶3-¶6): a request of 120% and 36 weekly
-- hours is updated to 140% and 42 hours for 1.11.2025-30.4.2026; until the
-- update is approved, the 120% request stays in force.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p3 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p4
`the example's earlier request` MEANS
    `entitlement request` WITH
        `request position size` IS 1.2
        `request weekly hours`  IS 36
        `request from day`      IS `1 September 2025`
        `request to day`        IS `30 April 2026`

`the example's updated request` MEANS
    `entitlement request` WITH
        `request position size` IS 1.4
        `request weekly hours`  IS 42
        `request from day`      IS `1 November 2025`
        `request to day`        IS `30 April 2026`

#ASSERT (`the request in force` `the example's earlier request` `the example's updated request` FALSE)'s `request position size` EQUALS 1.2
#ASSERT (`the request in force` `the example's earlier request` `the example's updated request` TRUE)'s `request weekly hours` EQUALS 42
-- Both of the example's requests sit at the 30-hour base: 120% is 36
-- hours and 140% is 42, and the larger one is within ו's ceilings.
#ASSERT 1.2 TIMES 30 EQUALS 36
#ASSERT `within the ceilings` 1.4 42

§§§ `Training for the owning bodies`

-- The training sessions (with the senior public-service division) are
-- planned for Sunday 31.8.2025 and Monday 8.9.2025 at 10:00. Further
-- information is in the owners' portal.
@ref akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p8 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p9 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p10 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p11 akn:art_4__hc_2__para_d/p12
`the training days` MEANS LIST `31 August 2025`, `8 September 2025`

-- The weekdays printed beside the dates agree with them: 1.9.2025 was a
-- Monday, so 31.8.2025 is a Sunday and 8.9.2025 a Monday (0 = Monday;
-- valid for day numbers from -7).
GIVEN d IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
DECIDE `weekday of` d IS
    (d PLUS 7) MODULO 7

#ASSERT `weekday of` `31 August 2025` EQUALS 6
#ASSERT `weekday of` `8 September 2025` EQUALS 0

