§§ `Worked examples`

-- Examples.
#ASSERT `the day file requests open` `the Haredi district` 200 EQUALS `1 September 2025`
#ASSERT `the day file requests open` `the Haredi district` 15 EQUALS `1 December 2025`
#ASSERT `the day file requests open` `the Haredi district` 3 EQUALS `1 March 2026`
#ASSERT NOT `the owner may file requests to open files on` `the Haredi district` 3 `1 December 2025`
#ASSERT `the owner may file requests to open files on` `another district` 3 `1 September 2025`
#ASSERT `reporting officers approved` 3 EQUALS 1
#ASSERT NOT `may be the reporting officer` (`reporting officer candidate` WITH `an employee of the owning body` IS FALSE, `a service provider` IS TRUE, `from human resources` IS TRUE)
#ASSERT NOT `the reported placement is allowed` 1 1.2
#ASSERT `the reported placement is allowed` 1.4 1.2

#TRACE `the three stages of a file` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the kindergarten teacher` DOES `fill and send the questionnaire with education and seniority documents` AT 3
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `approve the file, certify the documents as true copies and report the institution` AT 10
    PARTY `the teaching-staff division` DOES `update grade and seniority, approve the documents and the file` AT 30
#TRACE `the owning body's yearly report` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the owning body` DOES `report the employment for the year` AT 40
-- An approval of 120% and a report of 130%: the breach.
#TRACE `no placement above the approved size` 1.2 AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `report a placement above a full position` 1.3 AT 20
#TRACE `the three stages of a position report` `coordinating teacher` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `choose the role` AT 1
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `report the placement data` AT 2
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `press save` AT 3
#TRACE `no deleting an approved request` AT 0 WITH
    PARTY `the reporting officer` DOES `delete and re-enter an approved request` AT 70
